    "A GitHub release or package link, for a package Avo doesn’t list. It must be made for %@ (arm64); Avo checks it against the release’s SHA-256." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tautan rilis atau paket GitHub, untuk paket yang tidak ada di daftar Avo. Paketnya harus dibuat untuk %@ (arm64); Avo mencocokkannya dengan SHA-256 rilisnya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Mac window: Back, game controls, Translate Screen, Device and Quick Settings always show in its title bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jendela Mac: Kembali, kontrol game, Terjemahkan Layar, Perangkat, dan Pengaturan Cepat selalu tampil di title bar-nya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A MindTheGapps .zip, or the folder it unzips to, that you downloaded yourself" : {
      "localizations" : {
