    "An image zip (aosp_cf_arm64_only_phone-img-….zip), the folder with its .img files, or the folder scripts/fetch-cuttlefish.sh made." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zip image (aosp_cf_arm64_only_phone-img-….zip), folder berisi file .img-nya, atau folder buatan scripts/fetch-cuttlefish.sh."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An open app’s Dock icon shows how many notifications it has in Android, as a phone’s home screen does." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ikon Dock aplikasi yang terbuka menunjukkan jumlah notifikasinya di Android, seperti layar utama ponsel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An upgrade can take your current apps and data along, but the older Android can’t use them afterwards." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Upgrade dapat membawa aplikasi dan data Anda saat ini, tetapi setelahnya Android yang lebih lama tidak dapat memakainya lagi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
