          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android Is Ready" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android Siap"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android Version" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Versi Android"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android Versions…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Versi Android…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android added the fingerprint." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android menambahkan sidik jari itu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android added “%@”." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android menambahkan “%@”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android already uses this data." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android sudah memakai data ini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android and its app windows run on the version of Avo you have now. Stop Android first to install cleanly (save your progress in open games), or install now and restart Android later: until then it keeps running as it is." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android dan jendela aplikasinya berjalan di versi Avo yang Anda punya sekarang. Hentikan Android dulu agar pemasangan bersih (simpan progres di game yang terbuka), atau pasang sekarang dan mulai ulang Android nanti: sampai saat itu Android tetap berjalan seperti adanya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android apps and games on your Mac" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikasi dan game Android di Mac Anda"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android apps find the back camera and the front one as on a phone. The Mac’s camera is not mirrored; apps mirror their own preview of the front one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App Android menemukan kamera belakang dan kamera depan seperti di ponsel. Kamera Mac tidak dicerminkan; app mencerminkan sendiri pratinjau kamera depan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android apps, at home on your Mac" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikasi Android, betah di Mac Anda"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android apps’ notifications appear in Notification Center, and clicking one opens its app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Notifikasi aplikasi Android muncul di Pusat Notifikasi, dan mengekliknya membuka aplikasinya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android asks for its settings when it is added" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android menanyakan pengaturannya saat widget ditambahkan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android can’t start fresh there." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android tidak dapat mulai dari awal di sana."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android couldn’t open the shared folder. Restart Android to try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android tidak bisa membuka folder bersama. Mulai ulang Android untuk mencoba lagi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android created this storage before the size was %lld GB. Change Size erases Android’s data and creates its storage again at the size you choose." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android membuat penyimpanan ini sebelum ukurannya diatur ke %lld GB. Ubah Ukuran menghapus data Android dan membuat penyimpanannya lagi dengan ukuran yang Anda pilih."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android creates its storage at this size when it first starts, and its Settings show this size. After that the size stays: changing it erases Android’s data. The disk only takes up the space Android fills." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android membuat penyimpanannya dengan ukuran ini saat pertama kali berjalan, dan Pengaturan-nya menampilkan ukuran ini. Setelah itu ukurannya tetap: mengubahnya menghapus data Android. Disk hanya memakai ruang yang diisi Android."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android did not recognize that finger." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android tidak mengenali jari itu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android draws at most this many frames per second, in every app. A screen’s own rate between 60 and 120 appears too, so Android runs in step with it. A rate above the one Android started at applies after a restart. 30 saves power and heat." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android menggambar paling banyak sejumlah ini frame per detik, di setiap aplikasi. Laju bawaan layar antara 60 dan 120 juga muncul, agar Android berjalan seirama dengannya. Laju di atas laju saat Android dinyalakan berlaku setelah Android dimulai ulang. 30 menghemat daya dan panas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android draws at most this many frames per second, in every app. Lower caps save power." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android menggambar paling banyak frame sebanyak ini per detik, di semua aplikasi. Batas yang lebih rendah menghemat daya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android forgets its fingerprints; your fingers stay in Settings › Fingerprints, to add again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android melupakan sidik jarinya; jari Anda tetap ada di Pengaturan › Sidik Jari untuk ditambahkan lagi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android forgets this fingerprint; apps and the lock screen no longer take it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android melupakan sidik jari ini; aplikasi dan layar kunci tidak lagi menerimanya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android gets a SIM on a simulated mobile network: the status bar shows its type and signal, apps read them, and with Wi-Fi off mobile data reaches the internet through this Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android mendapat SIM di jaringan seluler simulasi: status bar menampilkan jenis dan sinyalnya, app bisa membacanya, dan saat Wi-Fi mati data seluler terhubung ke internet lewat Mac ini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android gets the screen of the phone chosen as device profile, its resolution and density, so apps lay out exactly as on that phone. The window keeps the phone's shape, and Interface size doesn't apply." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android mendapat layar ponsel yang dipilih sebagai profil perangkat, lengkap dengan resolusi dan DPI-nya, jadi tata letak aplikasi persis seperti di ponsel itu. Jendela tetap berbentuk seperti ponselnya, dan Ukuran tampilan tidak berlaku."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android goes on with the new place either way; the old copy stays as it is now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android tetap memakai tempat baru; salinan lama tetap seperti sekarang."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android has Bluetooth: its apps can turn it on, scan and connect, as on a phone. The devices it finds are the ones this Mac shares, below." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android punya Bluetooth: aplikasinya bisa menyalakannya, memindai, dan menyambung seperti di ponsel. Perangkat yang ditemukannya adalah yang dibagikan Mac ini, di bawah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android has no screen lock yet: its Settings app asks for one when you add a fingerprint." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android belum punya kunci layar: aplikasi Setelan-nya akan memintanya saat Anda menambahkan sidik jari."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android has this finger" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android sudah punya jari ini"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android has this folder as “Avo Shared” in its storage (%@)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Folder ini ada di storage Android sebagai “Avo Shared” (%@)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android image" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Image Android"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android images, Avo’s settings and key mappings stay on each Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Image Android, pengaturan Avo, dan key mapping tetap di masing-masing Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android is locked by its screen lock. Your apps open after you unlock it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android terkunci oleh kunci layarnya. Aplikasi Anda terbuka setelah Anda membuka kuncinya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android is not running" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android tidak berjalan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android is paused" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android dijeda"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android is paused to save energy. Opening an app resumes it too." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android dijeda untuk menghemat energi. Membuka aplikasi juga melanjutkannya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android is pausing…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android sedang dijeda…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android is ready" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android siap"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android is saving its state…" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android sedang menyimpan statusnya…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android is starting…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android sedang dimulai…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android is stopped" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android berhenti"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android is stopping…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android sedang dihentikan…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android is suspended" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android ditangguhkan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android isn’t set up yet" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android belum disiapkan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android isn’t set up yet. Choose a version to download or an image on this Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android belum disiapkan. Pilih versi untuk diunduh atau image di Mac ini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android keeps the resolution below when you resize the window or enter full screen. Enlarging the window enlarges the picture; it doesn't give the app more room." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Resolusi Android tetap walau jendela diubah ukurannya atau dibuat layar penuh. Memperbesar jendela akan memperbesar gambar, bukan menambah ruang untuk aplikasi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android keeps using its data in %@. Without the copy, Use Avo’s Own Storage can only start fresh." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android tetap memakai datanya di %@. Tanpa salinan ini, Pakai Penyimpanan Avo Sendiri hanya bisa mulai dari awal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android lays out for %@ dp at %lld dpi." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Android lays out for %1$@ dp at %2$lld dpi."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android menata tampilan untuk %@ dp pada %lld dpi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android memory" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Memori Android"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android not installed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android belum terpasang"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android notifications always appear in Avo’s Notifications list. Once macOS allows Avo, they appear in Notification Center too, grouped by app; clicking one opens its app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Notifikasi Android selalu muncul di daftar Notifikasi Avo. Setelah macOS mengizinkan Avo, notifikasi juga muncul di Pusat Notifikasi, dikelompokkan per aplikasi; mengekliknya membuka aplikasinya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android notifications only appear in this list. Request permission to see them in Notification Center as well." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Notifikasi Android hanya muncul di daftar ini. Minta izin agar notifikasi juga tampil di Pusat Notifikasi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android notifications only appear in this list. Turn on Allow Notifications for Avo to see them in Notification Center." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Notifikasi Android hanya muncul di daftar ini. Nyalakan Izinkan Notifikasi untuk Avo agar tampil di Pusat Notifikasi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android reaches the internet through this Mac, over Wi-Fi. Turned off, Android is offline, as a phone with Wi-Fi off and no mobile data." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android terhubung ke internet lewat Mac ini, melalui Wi-Fi. Kalau dimatikan, Android offline, seperti ponsel dengan Wi-Fi mati dan tanpa data seluler."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android reads and writes the shared folder’s files on this drive while it runs. macOS asks next whether “Avo” may access files on a removable volume: choose Allow." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android membaca dan menulis file folder bersama di drive ini selama berjalan. Setelah ini macOS menanyakan apakah “Avo” boleh mengakses file di volume yang dapat dilepas: pilih Izinkan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android reads and writes the shared folder’s files while it runs. macOS may ask next whether “Avo” may access files in your %@ folder: choose Allow." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android membaca dan menulis file folder bersama selama berjalan. Setelah ini macOS mungkin menanyakan apakah “Avo” boleh mengakses file di folder %@ Anda: pilih Izinkan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android recognized the finger." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android mengenali jari itu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android recognized “%@”." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android mengenali “%@”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android renders 2 or 4 times the pixels at the same layout, and Avo shrinks the picture to the window: the smoothest edges, but the GPU draws that many more pixels." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android merender 2 atau 4 kali piksel dengan tata letak yang sama, lalu Avo memperkecil gambarnya ke jendela: tepi paling halus, tapi GPU menggambar piksel sebanyak itu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android renders at the window's size, so text stays sharp. Resizing the window changes Android's resolution." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android merender seukuran jendela, jadi teks tetap tajam. Mengubah ukuran jendela akan mengubah resolusi Android."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android renders fewer pixels and Avo enlarges the picture to fill the window. The layout stays the same." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android merender lebih sedikit piksel dan Avo memperbesar gambarnya hingga memenuhi jendela. Tata letaknya tetap sama."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android renders in software on this Mac’s CPU, so this many pixels can make apps and games slow. A lower resolution, or the GPU renderer under Rendering, runs faster." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android merender secara software di CPU Mac ini, jadi piksel sebanyak ini bisa membuat aplikasi dan game lambat. Resolusi yang lebih rendah, atau renderer GPU di bagian Rendering, berjalan lebih cepat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android renders in software on this Mac’s CPU." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android merender secara software memakai CPU Mac ini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android renders on this Mac’s GPU (%@)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android merender dengan GPU Mac ini (%@)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android renders on this Mac’s GPU." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android merender dengan GPU Mac ini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android runs the previous version" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android berjalan di versi sebelumnya"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android runs with another version. Restart it to use the new one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android berjalan dengan versi lain. Mulai ulang untuk memakai versi yang baru."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android sees the folder as “Avo Shared” in its storage, where its file pickers, file managers and apps find it. What Android saves there is on your Mac at once, and what you put there on the Mac appears in Android within a few seconds." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android melihat folder ini sebagai “Avo Shared” di storage-nya, tempat pemilih file, pengelola file, dan aplikasinya menemukannya. Yang disimpan Android di sana langsung ada di Mac Anda, dan yang Anda taruh di sana dari Mac muncul di Android dalam beberapa detik."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android set it when it created its storage, and it stays: Android’s storage can change size only when it is empty, so Change Size erases Android’s data." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android menetapkannya saat membuat penyimpanannya, dan ukuran itu tetap: penyimpanan Android hanya bisa berubah ukuran saat kosong, jadi Ubah Ukuran menghapus data Android."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android shares the folder from its next start." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android berbagi folder ini mulai saat berikutnya ia dijalankan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android shares the folder once its screen lock is entered." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android berbagi folder ini setelah kunci layarnya dimasukkan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android shares the folder when it starts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android berbagi folder ini saat dijalankan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android started with a screen lock, so your apps stay closed until you unlock it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android dimulai dengan kunci layar, jadi aplikasi Anda tetap tertutup sampai Anda membuka kuncinya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android starts as soon as it is downloaded. You can close this window: the download goes on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android dijalankan begitu selesai diunduh. Anda bisa menutup jendela ini: unduhan tetap berlanjut."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android starts empty there, like a new phone. Choose an empty folder." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android mulai kosong di sana, seperti ponsel baru. Pilih folder yang kosong."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android starts empty there, like a new phone. The data it has now stays where it is." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android mulai kosong di sana, seperti ponsel baru. Data yang dimilikinya sekarang tetap di tempatnya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android starts with the version you choose the next time it starts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android memakai versi yang Anda pilih saat dijalankan berikutnya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android status" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Status Android"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android stopped with an error" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android berhenti karena kesalahan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android stops first; open apps close." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android dihentikan terlebih dahulu; aplikasi yang terbuka ditutup."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android storage" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Penyimpanan Android"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android system" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sistem Android"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android takes the window's shape. Changing the shape (dragging an edge, full screen) makes Android lay out again once." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android mengikuti bentuk jendela. Mengubah bentuknya (menarik tepi jendela, layar penuh) membuat Android menata ulang tampilannya sekali."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android takes up to %lld fingerprints. Renaming one in Android’s Settings app renames it here too. Removing a finger here removes it from Android as well; removing it in Android, removing Android’s screen lock or Reset Android only takes it out of Android." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android menerima paling banyak %lld sidik jari. Mengganti nama di aplikasi Setelan Android juga mengganti namanya di sini. Menghapus jari di sini juga menghapusnya dari Android; menghapusnya di Android, menghapus kunci layar Android, atau Reset Android hanya mengeluarkannya dari Android."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android version" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Versi Android"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android versions" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Versi Android"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android volume" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Volume Android"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android wants its PIN, pattern or password before a fingerprint." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android meminta PIN, pola, atau sandinya sebelum sidik jari."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android wants its PIN, pattern or password once after it starts; fingerprints work after that." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android meminta PIN, pola, atau sandinya sekali setelah dinyalakan; sesudah itu sidik jari bisa dipakai."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android's density stops at its highest, 640 dpi, so apps lay out for %@ dp: a little smaller than at lower resolutions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DPI Android berhenti di batas tertingginya, 640, jadi aplikasi menata tampilan untuk %@ dp: sedikit lebih kecil daripada di resolusi yang lebih rendah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android’s Settings is adding a fingerprint: touch with the finger to add." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Setelan Android sedang menambahkan sidik jari: sentuh dengan jari yang ingin ditambahkan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android’s apps and data can no longer go back to it. The space only this checkpoint takes becomes free." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikasi dan data Android tidak bisa lagi dikembalikan ke checkpoint ini. Ruang yang hanya dipakai checkpoint ini menjadi kosong."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android’s apps and data are kept as they are now. A running Android holds still for a moment." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikasi dan data Android disimpan seperti sekarang. Android yang sedang berjalan berhenti sejenak."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android’s apps and data from another Mac, in the “Avo Android Data” folder Avo made there. Android starts with them, where they are." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikasi dan data Android dari Mac lain, di folder “Avo Android Data” yang dibuat Avo di sana. Android berjalan dengan data itu, di tempatnya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android’s apps and data go back to how they were on %@. What Android has now is kept as a checkpoint, so you can come back to it. A running Android restarts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikasi dan data Android kembali seperti pada %@. Isi Android saat ini disimpan sebagai checkpoint, jadi Anda bisa kembali ke sana. Android yang sedang berjalan dimulai ulang."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android’s apps hear this Mac’s microphone while they record, like voice notes and calls. macOS asks for permission the first time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App Android mendengar mikrofon Mac ini selama merekam, seperti pesan suara dan panggilan. macOS meminta izin pertama kali."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android’s data is there already." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Data Android sudah ada di sana."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android’s storage can change size only when it is empty. All Android apps, accounts and files are erased; Avo’s settings and the Android image are kept. Android creates its storage at the new size when it next starts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Penyimpanan Android hanya bisa berubah ukuran saat kosong. Semua aplikasi, akun, dan file Android dihapus; pengaturan Avo dan image Android tetap disimpan. Android membuat penyimpanannya dengan ukuran baru saat berjalan berikutnya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikasi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App Info…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Info Aplikasi…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App Page" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Halaman Aplikasi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App bar style" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gaya app bar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App shortcuts" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pintasan aplikasi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App windows" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jendela aplikasi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple's MetalFX keeps edges and text sharp when the picture is enlarged. Best for most games." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MetalFX buatan Apple menjaga tepi dan teks tetap tajam saat gambar diperbesar. Paling cocok untuk kebanyakan game."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple’s MetalFX keeps edges and text sharp when the picture is enlarged. Best for most games." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MetalFX buatan Apple menjaga tepi dan teks tetap tajam saat gambar diperbesar. Paling cocok untuk kebanyakan game."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applies after Android restarts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Berlaku setelah Android dimulai ulang."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applies after Android restarts. This Mac has %lld performance cores and %llu GB of memory." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Applies after Android restarts. This Mac has %1$lld performance cores and %2$llu GB of memory."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Berlaku setelah Android dimulai ulang. Mac ini punya %lld core performa dan memori %llu GB."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applies after Android restarts. Up to this Mac’s performance cores keeps macOS responsive." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Berlaku setelah Android dimulai ulang. Selama tidak melebihi core performa Mac ini, macOS tetap responsif."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applies to windows you open next; no restart needed. Apps can still request their own orientation." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Berlaku untuk jendela yang dibuka berikutnya, tanpa perlu mulai ulang. Aplikasi tetap bisa meminta orientasinya sendiri."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Approximate location" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lokasi perkiraan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikasi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps and Games are the two presets in Settings › Graphics. Avo picks one by itself (an app with key mapping, or one Android lists as a game, is a game); the changes made on this page stay on top of either." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikasi dan Game adalah dua preset di Pengaturan › Grafis. Avo memilih salah satunya sendiri (aplikasi yang punya pemetaan tombol, atau yang dicatat Android sebagai game, dianggap game); perubahan di halaman ini tetap berlaku di atas keduanya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps and data go along to %@. %@ can’t use them afterwards." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikasi dan data ikut pindah ke %1$@. Setelahnya %2$@ tidak dapat memakainya lagi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps can ask for root, and Magisk asks you about each one. Avo downloads Magisk from its GitHub page, adds it to Android’s boot ramdisk and starts Android again with it. Android’s data stays as it is." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App bisa meminta root, dan Magisk menanyakannya ke kamu satu per satu. Avo mengunduh Magisk dari halaman GitHub-nya, menambahkannya ke ramdisk boot Android, lalu menyalakan ulang Android dengannya. Data Android tetap seperti semula."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps in the Dock" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikasi di Dock"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps that ask for GPS get this Mac’s location. macOS asks the first time an app needs it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikasi yang meminta GPS mendapat lokasi Mac ini. macOS bertanya saat pertama kali ada aplikasi yang membutuhkannya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps that ask for GPS get where this Mac is (as macOS knows it, usually from Wi-Fi). macOS asks for permission the first time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App yang meminta GPS mendapat lokasi Mac ini (sebagaimana diketahui macOS, biasanya dari Wi-Fi). macOS meminta izin pada kali pertama."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps that check device integrity (banking, payments, some games) will refuse to run while Android is rooted." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikasi yang memeriksa integritas perangkat (bank, pembayaran, sebagian game) akan menolak berjalan selama Android di-root."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps that check the device’s integrity (banking, payments, some games) may refuse to run while Android is rooted. Turned off, Android starts without Magisk the next time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App yang memeriksa integritas perangkat (perbankan, pembayaran, sebagian game) bisa menolak berjalan selama Android di-root. Kalau dimatikan, Android berjalan tanpa Magisk pada start berikutnya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps that record, like voice notes and calls, hear this Mac’s microphone, only while they record." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikasi yang merekam, seperti catatan suara dan panggilan, mendengar mikrofon Mac ini hanya selama merekam."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps that unlock a key with your fingerprint, as some banking apps and password managers do, see the touch but cannot use that key: Android’s virtual sensor has no secure hardware to vouch for it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikasi yang membuka kunci kriptografi dengan sidik jari, seperti sebagian aplikasi bank dan pengelola sandi, menerima sentuhannya tetapi tidak bisa memakai kunci itu: sensor virtual Android tidak punya perangkat keras aman untuk menjaminnya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps with a key mapping, or set to game graphics on their page, are games." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikasi yang punya pemetaan tombol, atau yang diatur ke grafis game di halamannya, termasuk game."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps with their own settings: %lld" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikasi dengan pengaturan sendiri: %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps write to it as well. Avo takes out email addresses, account names and tokens." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikasi juga menulis ke log ini. Avo menghapus alamat email, nama akun, dan token darinya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask before quitting a game" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tanya sebelum keluar dari game"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asking for the download link and checking free disk space." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Meminta tautan unduhan dan memeriksa ruang disk yang tersedia."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aspect ratio" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rasio aspek"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aurora Store" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aurora Store"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Otomatis"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic uses this Mac’s GPU, and software rendering when the GPU cannot start." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Otomatis memakai GPU Mac ini, dan rendering software jika GPU tidak bisa dimulai."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Available" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tersedia"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Available again when Avo finishes changing Google apps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tersedia lagi setelah Avo selesai mengubah aplikasi Google."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Available once Avo’s background service runs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tersedia setelah layanan latar belakang Avo berjalan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Available while Android is running" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tersedia saat Android berjalan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Average" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rata-rata"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo Settings" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pengaturan Avo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo Shared" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo Shared"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo copies Android’s data back to this Mac (%@), checks the copy, then uses it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo menyalin data Android kembali ke Mac ini (%@), memeriksa salinannya, lalu memakainya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo copies Android’s data there (%@), checks every byte of the copy, then uses it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo menyalin data Android ke sana (%@), memeriksa setiap byte salinannya, lalu memakainya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo couldn’t list the Android versions to download." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo tidak bisa menampilkan daftar versi Android yang bisa diunduh."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo doesn’t include Google apps. Most apps work without them, and F-Droid or Aurora Store can install apps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo tidak menyertakan aplikasi Google. Sebagian besar aplikasi berjalan tanpanya, dan F-Droid atau Aurora Store bisa menginstal aplikasi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo downloads Android from Google’s public build servers (about 1 GB, 2 GB on disk), or uses an image you already have." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo mengunduh Android dari server build publik Google (sekitar 1 GB, 2 GB di disk), atau memakai image yang sudah Anda punya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo downloads Android from Google’s public build servers: about 1 GB, 2 GB on disk. You can switch versions later in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo mengunduh Android dari server build publik Google: sekitar 1 GB, 2 GB di disk. Anda bisa mengganti versi nanti di Pengaturan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo downloads Magisk from GitHub and starts Android again with it. Apps that check the device’s integrity (banking, payments, some games) may refuse to run while Android is rooted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo mengunduh Magisk dari GitHub dan menyalakan ulang Android dengannya. App yang memeriksa integritas perangkat (perbankan, pembayaran, sebagian game) bisa menolak berjalan selama Android di-root."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo downloads it first (%@); Android keeps using the current version until then." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo mengunduhnya terlebih dahulu (%@); sampai selesai, Android tetap memakai versi saat ini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo engine" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mesin Avo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo installs the MindTheGapps package for Android’s version (arm64): the newest build from MindTheGapps’ GitHub releases, which Avo checks against its SHA-256, or a .zip or unzipped folder you downloaded." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo menginstal paket MindTheGapps untuk versi Android Anda (arm64): build terbaru dari rilis GitHub MindTheGapps, yang dicocokkan Avo dengan SHA-256-nya, atau file .zip atau folder hasil ekstrak yang Anda unduh."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo is changing Google apps and restarts Android by itself meanwhile. Wait until it finishes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo sedang mengubah aplikasi Google, dan selama itu Avo memulai ulang Android sendiri. Tunggu sampai selesai."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo is made for Android 16 and newer. Older versions may not start, or may restart over and over; Google builds Android 13 and 14 for virtual devices only with 32-bit parts, which Apple silicon can’t run." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo dibuat untuk Android 16 dan yang lebih baru. Versi lama mungkin tidak bisa dimulai, atau terus memulai ulang; Google membuat Android 13 dan 14 untuk perangkat virtual hanya dengan komponen 32-bit, yang tidak dapat dijalankan Apple silicon."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo keeps the previous version, so you can switch back." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo menyimpan versi sebelumnya, jadi Anda bisa kembali ke versi itu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo never ships Google apps. To use Google Play, install a MindTheGapps package you download yourself under Google apps below." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo tidak pernah menyertakan aplikasi Google. Untuk memakai Google Play, instal paket MindTheGapps yang Anda unduh sendiri di bagian Aplikasi Google di bawah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo reads and writes Android’s data in this folder while Android runs. macOS may ask next whether “Avo” may access files in your %@ folder: choose Allow." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo membaca dan menulis data Android di folder ini selama Android berjalan. Setelah ini macOS mungkin menanyakan apakah “Avo” boleh mengakses file di folder %@ Anda: pilih Izinkan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo reads and writes Android’s data on this drive while Android runs. macOS asks next whether “Avo” may access files on a removable volume: choose Allow. Without it Android can’t use the drive." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo membaca dan menulis data Android di drive ini selama Android berjalan. Setelah ini macOS menanyakan apakah “Avo” boleh mengakses file di volume yang dapat dilepas: pilih Izinkan. Tanpa izin itu Android tidak bisa memakai drive ini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo restarts Android by itself. Don’t stop or reset Android until this finishes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo memulai ulang Android sendiri. Jangan hentikan atau reset Android sampai proses ini selesai."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo runs AOSP, Android’s open-source build for virtual devices (Cuttlefish), which it downloads from Google’s public build servers or takes from an image on this Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo menjalankan AOSP, build Android open source untuk perangkat virtual (Cuttlefish), yang diunduh dari server build publik Google atau diambil dari image di Mac ini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo runs Android apps on your Mac, each in its own window." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo menjalankan aplikasi Android di Mac Anda, masing-masing di jendelanya sendiri."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo runs Android in a light virtual machine on Apple silicon. Every app opens in its own Mac window, and games draw with your Mac’s GPU." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo menjalankan Android di mesin virtual yang ringan di Apple silicon. Setiap aplikasi terbuka di jendela Mac-nya sendiri, dan game digambar dengan GPU Mac Anda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo saves a report on this Mac. Attach it to your message to Avo’s developers: Avo sends nothing by itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo menyimpan laporan di Mac ini. Lampirkan laporan itu ke pesan Anda untuk pengembang Avo: Avo tidak mengirim apa pun dengan sendirinya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo starts Android in the background." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo menjalankan Android di latar belakang."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo takes Google apps out of Android’s system partitions and uninstalls Google Play services, the Play Store and the Google app with their data, which signs this device out of Google. Your other apps and their data stay. Android may restart, and open Android apps close.\n\nYou can then install Google apps again here. They get a new Android ID, which you register again before you sign in." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo mengeluarkan aplikasi Google dari partisi sistem Android dan menguninstal Layanan Google Play, Play Store, dan aplikasi Google beserta datanya, sehingga perangkat ini keluar dari akun Google. Aplikasi lain beserta datanya tetap ada. Android mungkin dimulai ulang, dan aplikasi Android yang terbuka akan ditutup.\n\nSetelah itu aplikasi Google bisa diinstal lagi di sini. Instalasi baru mendapat Android ID baru yang perlu didaftarkan lagi sebelum masuk ke akun Google."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo tells apps what it is: a device made by Avo, model AVO-Droid, running on a Mac. Games can recognize it and treat it like a PC." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo memberi tahu aplikasi siapa dirinya: perangkat buatan Avo, model AVO-Droid, yang berjalan di Mac. Game bisa mengenalinya dan memperlakukannya seperti PC."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo uses game settings because the app says it is a game." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo memakai pengaturan game karena aplikasi ini menyatakan dirinya game."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo uses game settings because this app has a key mapping." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo memakai pengaturan game karena aplikasi ini punya pemetaan tombol."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo uses the data where it is: Android starts with your apps, accounts and files, and nothing is copied to this Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo memakai data di tempatnya: Android berjalan dengan aplikasi, akun, dan file Anda, dan tidak ada yang disalin ke Mac ini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo uses the same settings as other apps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo memakai pengaturan yang sama dengan aplikasi lain."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo was updated while Android was running. Android keeps running as it was, and moves to the new version the next time it stops. Restart Android does that now: save your progress in open games first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo diperbarui saat Android sedang berjalan. Android tetap berjalan seperti sebelumnya, dan pindah ke versi baru saat berikutnya berhenti. Mulai Ulang Android melakukannya sekarang: simpan dulu progres di game yang terbuka."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo was updated while it was open. Quit Avo and open it again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avo diperbarui saat sedang terbuka. Keluar dari Avo lalu buka lagi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo’s background service is not running. %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Layanan latar belakang Avo tidak berjalan. %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo’s background service isn’t running yet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Layanan latar belakang Avo belum berjalan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo’s own storage" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "penyimpanan Avo sendiri"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avo’s own storage still holds a copy of Android’s data from before. It is erased first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Penyimpanan Avo sendiri masih berisi salinan data Android dari sebelumnya. Salinan itu dihapus terlebih dahulu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kembali"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back camera" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kamera belakang"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Background" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Latar belakang"
          }
        }
