          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For development: apps read this phone’s SoC, CPU, GPU and screen, so a build’s per-device code paths (a chipset or brand check) run as they would on the real phone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Untuk pengembangan: aplikasi membaca SoC, CPU, GPU, dan layar ponsel ini, sehingga jalur kode per perangkat (pemeriksaan chipset atau merek) berjalan seperti di ponsel aslinya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For example: the game froze when I opened its shop, after Android had been paused." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Contoh: game macet saat saya membuka tokonya, setelah Android dijeda."
