    "Google Play services is no longer a system app: its system files are gone and only Google Play’s update of it is left, so Google sign-in fails. Remove Google apps, then install them again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Layanan Google Play bukan lagi aplikasi sistem: file sistemnya hilang dan hanya update-nya dari Google Play yang tersisa, sehingga masuk ke akun Google gagal. Hapus aplikasi Google, lalu instal lagi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
