    "Install apps by double-clicking .apk files or dropping them on Avo’s window. Each app gets its own window and Dock icon." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Instal aplikasi dengan klik dua kali file .apk atau meletakkannya di jendela Avo. Setiap aplikasi mendapat jendela dan ikon Dock sendiri."
