          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installed. The app is in Launchpad and Android Apps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Terinstal. Aplikasinya ada di Launchpad dan Android Apps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installing Google apps as system apps…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Menginstal aplikasi Google sebagai aplikasi sistem…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installing Google apps turns off Android’s verified boot for the system partitions of this Avo VM, so they can hold Google’s system apps. Android restarts up to three times, and open Android apps close. If something goes wrong, Avo takes the files out again and restores Android.\n\nThis Android is an uncertified test build: before you sign in to Google, register its Android ID at google.com/android/uncertified. Avo shows the ID here once Google Play services has one. Reset Android removes Google apps again; the next install gets a new Android ID to register." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Menginstal aplikasi Google akan menonaktifkan verified boot Android untuk partisi sistem VM Avo ini, agar partisi itu bisa memuat aplikasi sistem Google. Android dimulai ulang hingga tiga kali, dan aplikasi Android yang terbuka akan ditutup. Jika terjadi masalah, Avo menghapus lagi file yang sudah disalin dan memulihkan Android.\n\nAndroid ini adalah build uji yang tidak tersertifikasi: sebelum masuk ke akun Google, daftarkan Android ID-nya di google.com/android/uncertified. Avo menampilkan ID tersebut di sini setelah Layanan Google Play mendapatkannya. Reset Android menghapus aplikasi Google lagi; instalasi berikutnya mendapat Android ID baru yang perlu didaftarkan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installing also copies %lld game data files (OBB) to Android/obb." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Installing also copies %lld game data file (OBB) to Android/obb."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Installing also copies %lld game data files (OBB) to Android/obb."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Instalasi juga menyalin %lld file data game (OBB) ke Android/obb."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installing…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Menginstal…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Interface size" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ukuran tampilan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It applies at once, to every app; Android still says it is on Wi-Fi." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Langsung berlaku untuk semua app; Android tetap menyebut dirinya tersambung ke Wi-Fi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its apps keep their place and use no CPU. System Status does not wake Android to look." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikasinya tetap di posisinya dan tidak memakai CPU. Status Sistem tidak membangunkan Android untuk melihatnya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its checkpoints are erased too." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Checkpoint-nya juga dihapus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its size on the Mac, in points" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ukurannya di Mac, dalam poin"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its speed is Network speed’s: choose the same type there for a connection as slow as the badge says." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kecepatannya mengikuti Kecepatan jaringan: pilih jenis yang sama di sana agar koneksinya selambat yang ditunjukkan ikonnya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep Android’s Data on “%@”" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Simpan Data Android di “%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep a copy in Avo’s own storage" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Simpan salinan di penyimpanan Avo sendiri"
