        }
      }
    },
    "Lets adb, Android Studio or scrcpy on this Mac control Android. Only this Mac can connect, but any app on it can then install apps and read Android’s data, so turn it off when you don’t need it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Memungkinkan adb, Android Studio, atau scrcpy di Mac ini mengontrol Android. Hanya Mac ini yang bisa tersambung, tetapi app apa pun di Mac ini lalu bisa menginstal app dan membaca data Android, jadi matikan saat tidak diperlukan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let’s set up Android: choose a version, allow a few things, and Avo starts it for you." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
