            "value" : "OK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nonaktif"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off in System Settings" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nonaktif di Pengaturan Sistem"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off until you allow it. macOS asks once." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nonaktif sampai Anda mengizinkannya. macOS hanya bertanya sekali."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off, Android has no Bluetooth, and Avo never uses the Mac’s. Applies when Android restarts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jika nonaktif, Android tidak punya Bluetooth, dan Avo tidak pernah memakai Bluetooth Mac. Berlaku setelah Android dimulai ulang."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off, Android has no camera, and Avo never uses the Mac’s." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jika nonaktif, Android tidak punya kamera, dan Avo tidak pernah memakai kamera Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off, Avo never reads or writes the Mac’s clipboard. Applies at once." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jika nonaktif, Avo tidak pernah membaca atau menulis papan klip Mac. Langsung berlaku."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off, they record silence, and Avo never opens the microphone. Applies at once." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jika nonaktif, app merekam hening, dan Avo tidak pernah membuka mikrofon. Langsung berlaku."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off. Turn on Allow Notifications for Avo in System Settings; macOS doesn’t ask again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nonaktif. Nyalakan Izinkan Notifikasi untuk Avo di Pengaturan Sistem; macOS tidak bertanya lagi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offline" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Offline"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Older Versions" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Versi Lama"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Older builds (%lld)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Build lama (%lld)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aktif"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On This Mac" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Di Mac Ini"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On Your Mac" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Di Mac Anda"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On this display the lowest is %lld%%, because Android's density can't go below 120 dpi." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Di layar ini paling rendah %lld%%, karena DPI Android minimal 120."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On “%@” (%@)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Di “%1$@” (%2$@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On, the engine gets ready as Avo starts, so the first translation in any app shows at once. Off, it starts when an app first translates, and the apps after it use the same engine." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jika aktif, mesin bersiap saat Avo mulai, jadi terjemahan pertama di app mana pun langsung muncul. Jika mati, mesin baru menyala saat sebuah app pertama kali menerjemahkan, lalu app berikutnya memakai mesin yang sama."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once a day, Avo looks for a new version. It asks before installing one, and before an update stops Android." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sekali sehari, Avo mencari versi baru. Avo bertanya dulu sebelum memasangnya, dan sebelum pembaruan menghentikan Android."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Buka"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Buka %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Android Settings" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Buka Setelan Android"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Google apps settings when setup is done" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Buka pengaturan aplikasi Google setelah penyiapan selesai"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Notification Settings" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Buka Pengaturan Notifikasi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open System Settings" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Buka Pengaturan Sistem"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open source" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Open source"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open windows adjust right away. Some apps reload their screen for a moment. Upscaling and sharpness change instantly." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jendela yang sedang terbuka langsung menyesuaikan. Beberapa aplikasi akan memuat ulang layarnya sebentar. Upscaling dan ketajaman berubah seketika."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open windows change right away. An app can have its own: Phone Style in its window’s Device menu, or App bar style in its Quick Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jendela yang terbuka langsung berubah. Satu aplikasi bisa punya gaya sendiri: Gaya Ponsel di menu Perangkat jendelanya, atau Gaya app bar di Pengaturan Cepat-nya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open windows show it right away. ⌥⌘P in an app window shows or hides it for that window. It isn't included in Avo's screenshots and screen recordings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jendela yang terbuka langsung menampilkannya. ⌥⌘P di jendela aplikasi menampilkan atau menyembunyikannya untuk jendela itu. HUD tidak ikut dalam tangkapan layar dan rekaman layar Avo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opening an app resumes it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Membuka aplikasi akan melanjutkannya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opening an app, avoctl or adb resumes it within a moment. While it is paused, Android does nothing in the background, so its notifications wait too." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Membuka aplikasi, avoctl, atau adb melanjutkannya dalam sekejap. Selama dijeda, Android tidak melakukan apa pun di latar belakang, jadi notifikasinya juga menunggu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens %@ in its own window" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Membuka %@ di jendelanya sendiri"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens MindTheGapps’ releases for %@ on GitHub" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Membuka rilis MindTheGapps untuk %@ di GitHub"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens the app with the key mapping editor over the game. In its window, ⇧⌘K opens it too." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Membuka aplikasinya dengan editor pemetaan tombol di atas game. Di jendelanya, ⇧⌘K juga membukanya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens the app. Press and hold for its page." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Membuka aplikasi. Tekan dan tahan untuk halamannya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Opsional"
          }
        }
      }
    },
